 elevation myocardial infarction results of the F.I.R.E. (Efficacy of FX06 in the Prevention of Myocardial Reperfusion Injury) trial</article-title><source>J Am Coll Cardiol</source><year>2009</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>720</fpage><lpage>729</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19232907</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>